   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>A scientist measures the height, <span data-math=\"h\">h</span>, of a tree each month, and <span data-math=\"m\">m</span> is the number of months since the scientist first measured the height of the tree. Is the height, <span data-math=\"h\">h</span>, a function of the month, <span data-math=\"m\">m</span>?</li>\n</ol>",
